{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-central-cee/audio/main-6c6161a57164.mp3","durationSec":100.128,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.52,"text":"Central Cee is a rapper from west London."},{"start":2.52,"end":5.4,"text":"A rapper says words to the beat of the music."},{"start":6.36,"end":9.32,"text":"Central Cee grew up in Shepherd's Bush, a part of west London."},{"start":9.96,"end":12.1,"text":"When he was young, he listened to music with his dad."},{"start":12.66,"end":14.22,"text":"His dad played hip-hop and reggae."},{"start":14.74,"end":16.74,"text":"He also found new music through his friends."},{"start":17.4,"end":19.88,"text":"His dad did not play much music from the UK."},{"start":20.7,"end":23.48,"text":"His friends played him a UK kind of music called grime."},{"start":24.06,"end":24.72,"text":"He loved it."},{"start":25.46,"end":29.12,"text":"As a teenager, he went into a music studio for the first time."},{"start":29.6,"end":31.96,"text":"A studio is a room where people make music."},{"start":31.96,"end":35.92,"text":"A friend from school took him there, and he made his first song."},{"start":36.62,"end":39.04,"text":"That visit helped him see what he could do with music."},{"start":40.04,"end":43.54,"text":"In 2021, Central Cee played a show in Shepherd's Bush."},{"start":44.28,"end":46.24,"text":"About two thousand fans came to see him."},{"start":46.82,"end":48.74,"text":"This was the part of London where he grew up."},{"start":49.22,"end":50.98,"text":"He was back in a place he knew well."},{"start":51.34,"end":53,"text":"The fans were there to hear his music."},{"start":53.7,"end":54.58,"text":"Dave is a rapper, too."},{"start":55.32,"end":57.22,"text":"He and Central Cee made a song together."},{"start":57.22,"end":59.66,"text":"Sprinter came out in 2023."},{"start":60.46,"end":62.94,"text":"It reached number one on the UK song chart."},{"start":63.84,"end":66.02,"text":"A song chart is a list of popular songs."},{"start":66.44,"end":68.18,"text":"The order can change every week."},{"start":68.94,"end":71.04,"text":"Number one is the top song on the list."},{"start":71.92,"end":73.82,"text":"Sprinter stayed at the top for ten weeks."},{"start":74.5,"end":76.54,"text":"That is more than two months at number one."},{"start":77.5,"end":80.36,"text":"An album is a group of songs that come out together."},{"start":80.98,"end":84.48,"text":"In 2025, Central Cee put out his first studio album."},{"start":84.88,"end":86.9,"text":"A studio album is made in a studio."},{"start":87.64,"end":89.96,"text":"His album is called Can't Rush Greatness."},{"start":90.76,"end":93.12,"text":"To rush means to try to do something too fast."},{"start":93.7,"end":96.38,"text":"His album reached number one on the UK album chart."},{"start":97.04,"end":99.68,"text":"So a song and an album both reached the top."}],"words":[{"text":"Central","start":0,"end":0.46},{"text":"Cee","start":0.46,"end":0.78},{"text":"is","start":0.78,"end":1},{"text":"a","start":1,"end":1.16},{"text":"rapper","start":1.16,"end":1.44},{"text":"from","start":1.44,"end":1.82},{"text":"west","start":1.82,"end":2.08},{"text":"London","start":2.08,"end":2.52},{"text":"A","start":2.52,"end":3.18},{"text":"rapper","start":3.18,"end":3.42},{"text":"says","start":3.42,"end":3.74},{"text":"words","start":3.74,"end":4.04},{"text":"to","start":4.04,"end":4.34},{"text":"the","start":4.34,"end":4.46},{"text":"beat","start":4.46,"end":4.68},{"text":"of","start":4.68,"end":4.94},{"text":"the","start":4.94,"end":5.06},{"text":"music","start":5.06,"end":5.4},{"text":"Central","start":6.36,"end":6.58},{"text":"Cee","start":6.58,"end":6.88},{"text":"grew","start":6.88,"end":7.1},{"text":"up","start":7.1,"end":7.26},{"text":"in","start":7.26,"end":7.42},{"text":"Shepherd's","start":7.42,"end":7.88},{"text":"Bush","start":7.88,"end":8.04},{"text":"a","start":8.32,"end":8.42},{"text":"part","start":8.42,"end":8.62},{"text":"of","start":8.62,"end